{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1157491-neutralization-specialist-corps-operational-divisions-and-mandates","id":1157491,"title":"Neutralization Specialist Corps - Operational Divisions and Mandates","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-10T04:02:29-08:00","id":1157491,"title":"Neutralization Specialist Corps - Operational Divisions and Mandates","content":"I'm currently running a Void Engineer-centric conspiracy campaign, and I have encountered a redoubtable obstacle in the form of NSC.<br /> <br /> NSC has three distinct divisions: namely, the Interface Defense Corps (called the \u201cMoonwatchers\u201d), the Spectral Neutralization Division (called the \u201cGhostbusters\u201d) and the Descartes Institute of Mental Health (DIMH).<br /> <br /> The roles of the latter two are easy to discern: SND neutralizes wraiths and banes(a.k.a. Entropic EDEs) while DIMH is basically a psych and conditioning division of Engineers.<br /> <br /> It leaves the IDC, supposedly the main division of the NSC. Their mandated role is &quot;to provide comprehensive protection the world, and when dangerous entities slip past the BCD, make a second line of defense right in our own back yard.&quot; In addition, according to the Guide, they are frequently investigate UFO crash sites. And I cannot help to think what exactly they are doing and how they are operating. I'm also devoid of idea how they are fighting off such entities, and why their cognomen is peculiar &quot;Moonwatchers.&quot;<br /> <br /> Since, AFAIF, they do not have any base, facility or installation on and around of the Moon.<br /> <br /> On the contrary, operations of Black Suits and SND are reasonably easy to envision and/or deduce. Everyone watched Men in Black and Ghostbusters, after all.<br /> <br /> In addition, VE Book states &quot;The main criticism of the NSC\u2019s field operatives by other Void Engineers is that they resemble the New World Order\u2019s Operations Methodology too much. Black Suits, IDC and SND implement similar tactics and Procedures, resort to violence in equal measure, and they even dress the same way.&quot;<br /> <br /> How is this possible? Why the IDC and SND have eventually developed into practical clones of the Operatives? Black Suits have a quite broad mandate and hold tremendous power at their disposal, to be sure, but mission statement and coverage of the IDC and SND is fairly narrow, idiosyncratic and extremely hazardous. That means each division should utilize very specialized armaments, gears, equipment and vehicles, and the both divisions would probably be more heavily armed, armored and teched-up than your typical MIB. Thus for all intent and purpose, differences between the IDC, SND and Operatives have to be substantial.<br /> <br /> Finally, could the IDC and SND co-operate with other VE Methodologies in Umb...sorry, Universe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4173,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4173-numinous","user":"Numinous","date":". 11-10-2017, 07:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4173-numinous","name":"Numinous","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-10T04:12:38-08:00","id":1157493,"title":"","content":"Introduction jargon states NSC are &quot;taking on really weird stuff&quot;. This particular paragraph also reinforces my assumption that NSC is being a specialized military force dealing with special kinds of enemies, even on the (really weird) criterion of VE.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4173-numinous","name":"Numinous","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-12T01:48:07-08:00","id":1157897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Numinous</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1157491-neutralization-specialist-corps-operational-divisions-and-mandates#post1157491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Finally, could the IDC and SND co-operate with other VE Methodologies in Umb...sorry, Universe?</div> </div> </div> </div>I see no reason why they couldn't; other than perhaps internal disagreements between the Void Engineers Methodologies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3254,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","user":"Muad'Dib","date":". 03-03-2018, 09:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}